.TH MOIN 1 "October 2026" "MoinMoin 1.9.11" "MoinMoin"
.SH NAME
moin \- MoinMoin wiki command line tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B moin
[\fIgeneral options\fR] \fIcommand\fR \fIsubcommand\fR [\fIspecific options\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B moin
runs maintenance and administration commands on a MoinMoin wiki, and
can run the wiki with its standalone web server.
.SH GENERAL OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config\-dir= DIR
directory containing the wiki configuration (wikiconfig.py or farmconfig.py)
.TP
.BI \-\-wiki\-url= URL
URL of the wiki (needed to select a wiki of a wiki farm), e.g. http://localhost/
.TP
.B \-q, \-\-quiet
be quiet (no informational messages)
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B account create|check|disable|homepage|inactive|resetpw
manage user accounts, e.g.
\fBaccount create \-\-name=NAME \-\-email=EMAIL \-\-password=PASSWORD\fR
.TP
.B cli show
render a page to standard output
.TP
.B export dump|package
export the wiki as static HTML pages or as a page package
.TP
.B import irclog|wikipage
import pages
.TP
.B index build
build the xapian search index (needs python3\-xapian)
.TP
.B maint cleancache|cleanpage|cleansessions|globaledit|makecache|mkpagepacks|reducewiki
maintenance of the wiki data
.TP
.B migration data
convert the data of old MoinMoin versions
.TP
.B server standalone
run the standalone web server
(\fB\-\-port\fR, \fB\-\-interface\fR, \fB\-\-user\fR, \fB\-\-group\fR)
.TP
.B xmlrpc mailimport|remote|retrieve|write
remote operations over XML\-RPC
.PP
Each subcommand shows its options with \fB\-\-help\fR, e.g.
\fBmoin account create \-\-help\fR.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
moin \-\-config\-dir=/srv/moin/mywiki \-\-wiki\-url=http://localhost/ account check
moin \-\-config\-dir=/srv/moin/mywiki server standalone \-\-port=8080
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR moin\-mkwiki (8),
/usr/share/doc/python3\-moinmoin/README.Debian
